{"id":"537a0f14593b849b","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-prg-next-bit-characterization.md","title":"Next-Bit Characterization of PRGs","display":"thm-prg-next-bit-characterization — Next-Bit Characterization of PRGs","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-prg-next-bit-characterization","aliases":["28-thm-prg-next-bit-characterization","Yao Next-Bit Test"],"display":"thm-prg-next-bit-characterization — Next-Bit Characterization of PRGs","depends_on":["[[28-df-prg]]","[[28-df-ppt]]","[[28-df-negl]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]"],"source_book_location":"Equation (9.4) and Theorem 9.11; printed pp.181–182; PDF pp.207–208","source_printed_pages":"181–182","source_pdf_pages":"207–208","source_status":"statement-checked","source_statement_verified":false,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"proof_status":"local-proof-reviewed","local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-prg-next-bit-characterization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-prg-next-bit-characterization</span><span>Yao Next-Bit Test</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-prg-next-bit-characterization — Next-Bit Characterization of PRGs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"10640aec74cc5cc9\" href=\"?note=10640aec74cc5cc9\" title=\"28-df-prg\">28-df-prg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Equation (9.4) and Theorem 9.11; printed pp.181–182; PDF pp.207–208"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"181–182"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"207–208"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(G\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\ell:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 在一元输入上多项式时间可计算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(n)&gt;n\">\\(\\ell(n)&gt;n\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall s\\in\\Sigma^n\\;|G(s)|=\\ell(n)\">\\(\\forall s\\in\\Sigma^n\\;|G(s)|=\\ell(n)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRG}(G,\\ell)\">\\(\\operatorname{PRG}(G,\\ell)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"10640aec74cc5cc9\" href=\"?note=10640aec74cc5cc9\" title=\"28-df-prg\">28-df-prg</a> 的仅样本区分器接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PPT}\">\\(\\mathbf{PPT}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Negl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Negl}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a>；多输入算法满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(u,v)=A(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(u,v))\">\\(A(u,v)=A(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(u,v))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle b\\rangle\">\\(\\langle b\\rangle\\)</span> 为比特 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 的单字符字串。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j\">\\(U_j\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^j\">\\(\\Sigma^j\\)</span> 上均匀分布，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{[j]}\">\\(U_{[j]}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[j]\">\\([j]\\)</span> 上均匀分布；所有算法随机性独立。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_{&lt;i}=y_1\\cdots y_{i-1}\">\\(y_{&lt;i}=y_1\\cdots y_{i-1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 由前缀长度加一恢复。下式定义一比特输出算法类、下一位平均优势以及显式提供安全参数的生成器谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRG}^{+}\">\\(\\operatorname{PRG}^{+}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PPT}_{01}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}:\\forall u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\Pr[A(u)\\in\\Sigma^1]=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{PPT}_{01}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathbf{PPT}:\\forall u\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\Pr[A(u)\\in\\Sigma^1]=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NextAdv}_{B,G,\\ell}(n)\\coloneqq\\left|\\Pr_{s\\leftarrow U_n,\\;i\\leftarrow U_{[\\ell(n)]}}[B(1^n,G(s)_{&lt;i})=\\langle G(s)_i\\rangle]-\\tfrac12\\right|\\qquad(B\\in\\mathbf{PPT}_{01}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NextAdv}_{B,G,\\ell}(n)\\coloneqq\\left|\\Pr_{s\\leftarrow U_n,\\;i\\leftarrow U_{[\\ell(n)]}}[B(1^n,G(s)_{&lt;i})=\\langle G(s)_i\\rangle]-\\tfrac12\\right|\\qquad(B\\in\\mathbf{PPT}_{01}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adv}^{+}_{D,G,\\ell}(n)\\coloneqq\\left|\\Pr[D(1^n,G(U_n))=\\langle1\\rangle]-\\Pr[D(1^n,U_{\\ell(n)})=\\langle1\\rangle]\\right|\\qquad(D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}_{01}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Adv}^{+}_{D,G,\\ell}(n)\\coloneqq\\left|\\Pr[D(1^n,G(U_n))=\\langle1\\rangle]-\\Pr[D(1^n,U_{\\ell(n)})=\\langle1\\rangle]\\right|\\qquad(D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}_{01}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRG}^{+}(G,\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}_{01}\\;\\operatorname{Adv}^{+}_{D,G,\\ell}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PRG}^{+}(G,\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}_{01}\\;\\operatorname{Adv}^{+}_{D,G,\\ell}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRG}^{+}(G,\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\mathbf{PPT}_{01}\\;\\operatorname{NextAdv}_{B,G,\\ell}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PRG}^{+}(G,\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\mathbf{PPT}_{01}\\;\\operatorname{NextAdv}_{B,G,\\ell}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRG}^{+}(G,\\ell)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{PRG}(G,\\ell).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PRG}^{+}(G,\\ell)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{PRG}(G,\\ell).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\exists h\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;h(1^{\\ell(n)})=1^n\\right)\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\operatorname{PRG}(G,\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{PRG}^{+}(G,\\ell)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\exists h\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;h(1^{\\ell(n)})=1^n\\right)\\Longrightarrow\\left(\\operatorname{PRG}(G,\\ell)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{PRG}^{+}(G,\\ell)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>R6修复两个接口缺口。第一，PPT本身允许任意串输出；若对全部PPT使用“猜对下一位概率与1/2的绝对差”，恒输出非比特串的算法就有优势1/2，使性质为空。现以正式集合式限定一比特预测器。第二，教材式(9.4)给预测器<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^n\">\\(1^n\\)</span>，本目录PRG却严格按Definition9.8只给样本；一般非单射伸长不能直接从样本长度恢复n。这里将泛伸长的下一位等价写成显式参数实验，并单列有长度恢复算法时与原PRG的桥接，未假定两接口对任意伸长自动相同。Hypothesis已经固定效率和伸长条件，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRG}^{+}\">\\(\\operatorname{PRG}^{+}\\)</span>仅在此候选域内定义安全性。</p>\n<p>本地证明：若B有非可忽略下一位优势，D在得到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1^n,y)\">\\((1^n,y)\\)</span>后随机选i，运行B于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1^n,y_{&lt;i})\">\\((1^n,y_{&lt;i})\\)</span>并以是否猜中<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_i\">\\(y_i\\)</span>输出一比特。在均匀y上成功率恰为1/2，故区分优势就是下一位优势。对任意非二次幂的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(n)\">\\(\\ell(n)\\)</span>，在最坏多项式时间内可用<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n+\\lceil\\log_2\\ell(n)\\rceil\">\\(n+\\lceil\\log_2\\ell(n)\\rceil\\)</span>个公平位取模，所得i分布与精确均匀的距离至多<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-n}\">\\(2^{-n}\\)</span>；这只加入可忽略误差。</p>\n<p>反向设一比特D区分<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G(U_n)\">\\(G(U_n)\\)</span>和均匀串。令<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_i\">\\(H_i\\)</span>保留生成串前i位、其余位独立均匀，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i=\\Pr[D(1^n,H_i)=1]\">\\(p_i=\\Pr[D(1^n,H_i)=1]\\)</span>。预测器B在得到前i−1位后独立猜测余下位<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z_i,\\ldots,z_{\\ell(n)}\">\\(z_i,\\ldots,z_{\\ell(n)}\\)</span>，以D的输出为1时输出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z_i\">\\(z_i\\)</span>、否则输出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1-z_i\">\\(1-z_i\\)</span>。条件于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z_i=y_i\">\\(z_i=y_i\\)</span>，D看到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_i\">\\(H_i\\)</span>；不加此条件时看到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_{i-1}\">\\(H_{i-1}\\)</span>。因此该位置猜中概率为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/2+p_i-p_{i-1}\">\\(1/2+p_i-p_{i-1}\\)</span>。对精确均匀i平均，得到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/2+(p_{\\ell(n)}-p_0)/\\ell(n)\">\\(1/2+(p_{\\ell(n)}-p_0)/\\ell(n)\\)</span>；取绝对值与多项式伸长保证非可忽略优势仍非可忽略。所需运行时间和公平随机位数均多项式有界。</p>\n<p>显式参数区分器可忽略<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^n\">\\(1^n\\)</span>，所以<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRG}^{+}\">\\(\\operatorname{PRG}^{+}\\)</span>无条件推出原PRG。若h存在，仅样本区分器先计算<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(1^{|y|})\">\\(h(1^{|y|})\\)</span>，再运行显式参数区分器，得到反向模拟；任意非比特输出区分器可先改为其“输出等于1”的示性算法。若有效<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span>单射且<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(n)&gt;n\">\\(\\ell(n)&gt;n\\)</span>，枚举<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&lt;|y|\">\\(k&lt;|y|\\)</span>查找<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(k)=|y|\">\\(\\ell(k)=|y|\\)</span>即可构造h，失败时输出空串；常用严格增长多项式伸长包含在内。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(G\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span>保证<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(n)\">\\(\\ell(n)\\)</span>多项式有界，全部模拟满足相应时间界。</p>\n<p>来源：Equation (9.4) and Theorem 9.11，印刷181–182页 / PDF207–208页；R6复读混合证明并逐式核对。旧稿的source_status=statement-checked仅表示曾比对教材表述；本次因显式区分两种接口，将当前陈述记为本地修复变体，source_statement_verified=false。local_proof_reviewed=true针对上述完整本地推导，不表示原书已经逐字给出长度桥接式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-prg","status":"resolved","id":"10640aec74cc5cc9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-prg]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-negl]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-prg","status":"resolved","id":"10640aec74cc5cc9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$G\\in\\mathbf{FP}$，$\\ell:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 在一元输入上多项式时间可计算，$\\ell(n)>n$ 且 $\\forall s\\in\\Sigma^n\\;|G(s)|=\\ell(n)$。$\\operatorname{PRG}(G,\\ell)$ 采用 [[28-df-prg]] 的仅样本区分器接口。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypo